@baseUrl = http://localhost:5140

### GET danh sách assignments (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments

### GET assignment đang tồn tại (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1

### GET assignment không tồn tại (404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/999

### POST submission hợp lệ (201 Created + Location)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Lê Hoàng Quân",
  "content": "Bài nộp kiểm thử từ requests.http"
}

### GET submission vừa tạo (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### GET submission không tồn tại (404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### POST submission không hợp lệ (400 INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": " ",
  "content": ""
}
